    "title": "Family Promise of Southern Delaware community brunch | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nFamily Promise of Southern Delaware community brunch\nFamily Promise of Southern Delaware community brunch, 10 a.m. to noon, VIA Clubhouse, Boardwalk & Grenoble Place, Rehoboth. Theme is Planting Seeds of Hope: Growing the Future Together, guest speaker is Bill Collick & unveiling of organization’s new strategic plan. Free, donations encouraged to support local families in need. To register or for more information go to givebutter.com/c/FPBrunch26 or call 302-579-0997.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 04/25/2026 - 10:00am to 12:00pm",
